    },
    {
     "en": "They're watching TV.",
     "fr": "Ils regardent la télé."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "explication",
   "fr": "Orthographe : make → making (on enlève le e), swim → swimming (on double la consonne), study → studying.",
   "en": "",
